ong> April 17, 192-<br><strong>Submitted by: <\/strong>Field Agent Benjamin Hale<br><strong>Category of Anomaly:<\/strong> Relic<br><strong>Type of Anomaly:<\/strong> Mechanism<br><strong>Location:<\/strong> Arkham, Massachusetts<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><br><em><strong>S<\/strong>ummary:<\/em><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>A watch which can possibly be set to count down the time toward a given alignment of the stars.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>However, the presumed \u201ctime\u201d seems to be a particularly impossible cosmic event. Sinister. The clock is composed of three arms, one which curves at the end and a series of horoscope-inspired visuals paired with other occult symbols, and yet also tells the time. A vexing find, to be sure.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Mechanical principle unknown.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>The watch is running, but there does not appear to be a way to wind up. Perpetual motion???<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<p><em>Annotated diagram attached overleaf:<\/em><\/p>\n\n\n<div class=\"lazyblock-simple-image-Z2dpQar wp-block-lazyblock-simple-image\">\n<section class=\"simple-image flex justify-center items-center w-full py-[75px]\">\n            <div class=\"simple-height relative w-full flex justify-center items-center px-4\">\n            <div class=\"relative mx-auto w-[85%] md:w-[35%]\">\n                <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/www.arkhamhorror.com\/wp-content\/themes\/asmodee-arkhamhorror\/assets\/img\/herobanner\/height\/bg_header_height.png\"\n                     alt=\"News image\"\n                     class=\"w-full h-full object-cover object-center\">\n\n                <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/www.arkhamhorror.com\/wp-content\/themes\/asmodee-arkhamhorror\/assets\/img\/herobanner\/height\/thumbnail_true.png\"\n                     alt=\"News image\"\n                     class=\"absolute z-10 thumbnail_news w-[90%]\"\n                     style=\"transform: rotate(1deg); top: 20px; left: 20px;\">\n\n                                <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/cdn.svc.asmodee.net\/production-arkhamhorror\/uploads\/image-converter\/2025\/07\/Astrological-Watch_diagram_simple-height.webp\"\n                     class=\"absolute h-full w-full object-cover rotate-1 thumbnail_bg\"\n                     style=\"top: 0px; left: 0px;\">\n\n                <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/www.arkhamhorror.com\/wp-content\/themes\/asmodee-arkhamhorror\/assets\/img\/news\/tape.png\"\n                     alt=\"News image\"\n                     class=\"absolute max-w-[150px] object-cover z-20\"\n                     style=\"transform: rotate(70deg); left: 30%; top: -45px;\"\/>\n            <\/div>\n        <\/div>\n    <\/section><\/div>\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Astronomical and astrological symbols. Do the hands indicate celestial alignments?<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>On the main face, each hand moves both clockwise and counterclockwise at different times. No pattern to the changes of direction discerned,as of now.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>The hands on the smaller face to the left have not moved since the object\u2019s discovery.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>The hand on the smaller face to the right has moved slightly counterclockwise over the course of a week.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>The speed suggests the divisions are months.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Does that make the other face an indicator of a year?<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<p>Counting down to an event? If so, a trigger?<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/www.arkhamhorror.com\/image-converter?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.svc.asmodee.net%2Fproduction-arkhamhorror%2Fuploads%2F2025%2F05%2FFoundation-Budget-Memoranda_Foundation-Starburst-1024x108.png&amp;attachment_id=2179\" alt=\"Foundation starburst\" class=\"wp-image-2179\"\/><\/figure>\n\n\n<div class=\"lazyblock-separator-Z1dHb5t wp-block-lazyblock-separator\"><div class=\"w-full h-px\"\n     style=\"background: linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.00) 